---
import ProjetLayout from "../../layouts/ProjetLayout.astro";
---

<ProjetLayout
  title="France Marine Services"
  description="Application web complète avec catalogue produits public et interface d'administration sécurisée"
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section
    class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary-500 to-secondary-600 mt-32"
  >
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center text-white">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6">
          France Marine Services
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl opacity-90 mb-8">
          Application web complète avec catalogue produits public et interface
          d'administration sécurisée
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
          <span
            class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full text-sm font-medium"
            >Angular 18</span
          >
          <span
            class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full text-sm font-medium"
            >Symfony 7</span
          >
          <span
            class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full text-sm font-medium"
            >MySQL</span
          >
          <span
            class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full text-sm font-medium"
            >Docker</span
          >
          <span
            class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full text-sm font-medium"
            >JWT</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contexte du projet -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <img
          src="/logo-fms-sans-fond.png"
          alt="Logo France Marine Services"
          class="h-36 w-36"
        />
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
          Contexte du projet
        </h2>
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Projet réalisé dans le cadre de mon stage chez France Marine
            Services, une entreprise spécialisée dans la vente d'équipements
            marins. L'objectif était de créer une application web moderne
            permettant de présenter le catalogue produits et de faciliter la
            gestion interne.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            Le projet a été développé en 1 mois, de la conception à la mise en
            production, en suivant une méthodologie agile avec des sprints de 2
            semaines.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Fonctionnalités principales -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">
          Fonctionnalités principales
        </h2>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
            <div
              class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6 text-primary-600"
                fill="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              >
                <path
                  d="M3 12v3c0 1.657 3.134 3 7 3s7-1.343 7-3v-3c0 1.657-3.134 3-7 3s-7-1.343-7-3z"
                ></path>
                <path
                  d="M3 7v3c0 1.657 3.134 3 7 3s7-1.343 7-3V7c0 1.657-3.134 3-7 3S3 8.657 3 7z"
                ></path>
                <path
                  d="M17 5c0 1.657-3.134 3-7 3S3 6.657 3 5s3.134-3 7-3 7 1.343 7 3z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">
              Catalogue produits
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              Interface publique avec système de filtres avancés (catégories,
              sous-catégories, fiches techniques) et recherche en temps réel.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
            <div
              class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6 text-primary-600"
                fill="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              >
                <path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-6-3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zm-2 4a5 5 0 00-4.546 2.916A5.986 5.986 0 0010 16a5.986 5.986 0 004.546-2.084A5 5 0 0010 11z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">
              Administration sécurisée
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              Interface admin complète avec EasyAdmin pour gérer produits,
              catégories, et utilisateurs avec authentification JWT.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
            <div
              class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6 text-primary-600"
                fill="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              >
                <path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M12.316 3.051a1 1 0 01.633 1.265l-4 12a1 1 0 11-1.898-.632l4-12a1 1 0 011.265-.633zM5.707 6.293a1 1 0 010 1.414L3.414 10l2.293 2.293a1 1 0 11-1.414 1.414l-3-3a1 1 0 010-1.414l3-3a1 1 0 011.414 0zm8.586 0a1 1 0 011.414 0l3 3a1 1 0 010 1.414l-3 3a1 1 0 11-1.414-1.414L16.586 10l-2.293-2.293a1 1 0 010-1.414z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">API RESTful</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              14 endpoints sécurisés pour la communication entre le frontend
              Angular et le backend Symfony.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
            <div
              class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6 text-primary-600"
                fill="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              >
                <path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h10a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2.22l.123.489.804.804A1 1 0 0113 18H7a1 1 0 01-.707-1.707l.804-.804L7.22 15H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5zm5.771 7H5V5h10v7H8.771z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">
              Design responsive
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              Interface moderne et adaptative développée avec Tailwind CSS,
              optimisée pour tous les appareils.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stack technique -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Stack technique</h2>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Frontend</h3>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <span
                class="px-4 py-2 bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-lg font-medium"
                >Angular 18</span
              >
              <span
                class="px-4 py-2 bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-lg font-medium"
                >TypeScript</span
              >
              <span
                class="px-4 py-2 bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-lg font-medium"
                >Tailwind CSS</span
              >
              <span
                class="px-4 py-2 bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-lg font-medium"
                >RxJS</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Backend</h3>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <span
                class="px-4 py-2 bg-accent-100 text-accent-700 rounded-lg font-medium"
                >Symfony 7</span
              >
              <span
                class="px-4 py-2 bg-accent-100 text-accent-700 rounded-lg font-medium"
                >PHP 8.2</span
              >
              <span
                class="px-4 py-2 bg-accent-100 text-accent-700 rounded-lg font-medium"
                >MySQL</span
              >
              <span
                class="px-4 py-2 bg-accent-100 text-accent-700 rounded-lg font-medium"
                >JWT</span
              >
              <span
                class="px-4 py-2 bg-accent-100 text-accent-700 rounded-lg font-medium"
                >EasyAdmin</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">DevOps</h3>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <span
                class="px-4 py-2 bg-secondary-100 text-secondary-700 rounded-lg font-medium"
                >Docker</span
              >
              <span
                class="px-4 py-2 bg-secondary-100 text-secondary-700 rounded-lg font-medium"
                >Git</span
              >
              <span
                class="px-4 py-2 bg-secondary-100 text-secondary-700 rounded-lg font-medium"
                >GitHub</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Résultats -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Résultats</h2>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
            <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">14</div>
            <div class="text-gray-700">Endpoints API</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
            <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">100%</div>
            <div class="text-gray-700">Responsive</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
            <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">1</div>
            <div class="text-gray-700">Mois de dev</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 bg-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Points clés</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                fill="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              >
                <path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              <span class="text-gray-700"
                >Architecture découplée avec API REST pour faciliter les
                évolutions futures</span
              >
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                fill="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              >
                <path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              <span class="text-gray-700"
                >Sécurité renforcée avec authentification JWT et protection CORS</span
              >
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                fill="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              >
                <path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              <span class="text-gray-700"
                >Conteneurisation Docker pour un déploiement simple et
                reproductible</span
              >
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-center items-center min-h-[600px] my-16">
      <div class="swiper w-1/2">
        <div class="swiper-wrapper">
          <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="/accueil-fms.png" /></div>
          <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="/accueil2.png" /></div>
          <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="/accueil3.png" /></div>
        </div>
        <!-- Pagination -->
        <div class="swiper-pagination"></div>
        <!-- Navigation -->
        <div class="swiper-button-prev"></div>
        <div class="swiper-button-next"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>

  <script>
    import Swiper from 'swiper';
    import { Autoplay, Navigation, Pagination } from 'swiper/modules';
    import 'swiper/css';
    import 'swiper/css/navigation';
    import 'swiper/css/pagination';

    new Swiper(".swiper", {
      modules: [Autoplay, Navigation, Pagination],
      loop: true,
      pagination: {
        el: ".swiper-pagination",
        clickable: true,
      },
      navigation: {
        nextEl: ".swiper-button-next",
        prevEl: ".swiper-button-prev",
      },
      autoplay: {
        delay: 3000,
      },
    });
  </script>
</ProjetLayout>
